OL,3,GNEWSAOrangemen and residents both back
OL,4,Ain court over Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Drumcree parading dispute is back
OL,7,Fin front of judges on Monday, with
OL,8,FPortadown Orangemen and Garvaghy Road
OL,9,Fresidents involved in separate court
OL,10,Fcases.
OL,12,FIt follows a decision on Friday by the
OL,13,FSecretary of State, Sir Chris Bryant,
OL,14,Fto ban the march, after receiving
OL,15,Fpolice advice.
OL,17,FWhile the move has eased the immediate
OL,18,Fsecurity situation, the issue remains
OL,19,Funresolved.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
